('History','EASY','Which Egyptian ruler was known as the boy king?','Tutankhamun','Tutankhamun became pharaoh as a child and ruled in the 14th century BCE.'),
('History','MEDIUM','Which ancient library was located in Egypt''s port city of Alexandria?','The Library of Alexandria','The ancient Library of Alexandria was part of a major scholarly institution in Ptolemaic Egypt.'),
('History','EASY','What was the name of the first human to travel into space?','Yuri Gagarin','Soviet cosmonaut Yuri Gagarin orbited Earth in Vostok 1 in 1961.'),
