('Nature','MEDIUM','What is the only continent where giraffes live naturally?','Africa','All wild giraffe species are native to sub-Saharan Africa.'),
('Nature','EASY','Which animal''s fingerprints can leave marks that resemble human prints?','The koala','Koala fingerprints are notably similar in ridge patterns to human fingerprints.'),
