('Science','MEDIUM','What is the only letter that does not appear in any chemical element symbol?','J','No currently assigned chemical element symbol contains the letter J.'),
('Science','EASY','Which human organ can regenerate a large portion of its tissue?','The liver','The liver can restore much of its mass after partial removal through cell growth.'),
